    "detailed_description": "[Note: RPG Maker has an unremovable &quot;feature&quot; where F12 resets the game to the title screen. You will have to change the screenshot key or manually take screenshots.]<br><br>Cat Attack is a game inspired by traditional 1990s JRPGs. It is most similar to Final Fantasy Mystic Quest or the Lufia series, with turn-based combat, enemy portraits and action results on the top of the screen, and party information at the bottom.<br><br>The game does not feature custom sprites but utilizes VX Ace's character creator.<br><br>Dungeons were designed by me and tested by myself and others, rather than using the random dungeon generator that comes with the program.<br><br>Features:<br><br>Variety of characters with their own unique skills and abilities<br>Plot-based learned skills<br>Tactics (weakness/absorb/resistance) to various elements<br>Dozens of weapons/armors/items<br>Dozens of unique enemies<br>100+ of skills/magic abilities",
    "about_the_game": "[Note: RPG Maker has an unremovable &quot;feature&quot; where F12 resets the game to the title screen. You will have to change the screenshot key or manually take screenshots.]<br><br>Cat Attack is a game inspired by traditional 1990s JRPGs. It is most similar to Final Fantasy Mystic Quest or the Lufia series, with turn-based combat, enemy portraits and action results on the top of the screen, and party information at the bottom.<br><br>The game does not feature custom sprites but utilizes VX Ace's character creator.<br><br>Dungeons were designed by me and tested by myself and others, rather than using the random dungeon generator that comes with the program.<br><br>Features:<br><br>Variety of characters with their own unique skills and abilities<br>Plot-based learned skills<br>Tactics (weakness/absorb/resistance) to various elements<br>Dozens of weapons/armors/items<br>Dozens of unique enemies<br>100+ of skills/magic abilities",
    "short_description": "JRPG similar to Final Fantasy/Lufia with an overworld and a variety of dungeons. Many party members with unique skills/abilities. Not early access, but will be updated in the future based on user input and other information.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
